r_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-06-24T14:28:33Z","updated_at":"2025-06-24T14:28:57Z","body":"I can confirm this on 4.5.beta 88b9932ce (Linux). In the MRP, this occurs with Quadrant Size set as low as `6` (it won't occur with `7` or `8`, `16` or `32` though). More errors will occur with higher values, until you eventually encounter a point where *fewer* errors will occur (but always at least 1).","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3000734404/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3078230265","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104452#issuecomment-3078230265","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104452","id":3078230265,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc63ehD5","user":{"login":"rburing","id":229837,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyOTgzNw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/229837?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing","html_url":"https://github.com/rburing","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rburing/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-16T11:51:50Z","updated_at":"2025-07-16T15:34:59Z","body":"The convex decomposition that fails is this one (narrowed down to a MRP):\n\n```gdscript\n@tool\nextends CollisionPolygon2D\n\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n    polygon = [\n        Vector2(2445.0, 885.0), Vector2(2445.0, 855.0), Vector2(2385.0, 915.0), Vector2(2385.0, 855.0),\n        Vector2(2445.0, 795.0), Vector2(2445.0, 735.0), Vector2(2565.0, 735.0), Vector2(2505.0, 795.0),\n        Vector2(2535.0, 795.0), Vector2(2535.0, 765.0), Vector2(2565.0, 765.0), Vector2(2565.0, 915.0),\n        Vector2(2415.0, 915.0), Vector2(2415.0, 885.0)\n    ]\n```\n\nVisually:\n\n<img width=\"413\" height=\"365\" alt=\"A polygon that fails to be decomposed into convex parts in Godot\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/379173db-6708-48c5-98d4-dbde9492a74a\" />\n\nThis is indeed a missing (collision) puzzle piece in the project in the first post (with quadrant size 6).\n\nI'll check if it's also an issue upstream.\n\n*Edit*: From [upstream](https://github.com/ivanfratric/polypartition) README.md:\n\n> All methods require that the input polygons are not self-intersecting\n\nI reported the issue just in case:\n\n- https://github.com/ivanfratric/polypartition/issues/58\n\nFrom another point of view the issue is that the *merging* step produces self-intersecting polygons.\n\nFor reference, these are the polygons being merged here:\n\n<img width=\"469\" height=\"470\" alt=\"Polygons to merge in Godot\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e60a9ec1-7551-4cc2-919d-3b5e745e61e8\" />\n\nQuestion for upstream:\n\n- https://github.com/AngusJohnson/Clipper2/discussions/996","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3078230265/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]